Z||000001||Raydar||11-14-1999||04:07 PM||||Not sure about the 355, but... if you care about a Diablo replica, the PISA Finale is absolutely gorgeous. Know someone who built one. He had *very positive* things to say, about both the quality of the kit, and the folks at PISA.  ||||reg||1
Z||000002||DaRkLoRD||11-14-1999||05:50 PM||||The Finale isn't a diablo replica, but it's an amazing kit. My favorite, as anyone who's seen my website will know.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>The Finale is produced in the UK, by a company called Candy Apple Cars. PISA is the US distributor, and there was one in Canada until just a few months ago called Split Pillar Corp. They've since stopped slling the Finale.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.digitalfusion.on.ca/fiero/finale.jpg"> ||||reg||1
